# Configuration for the proxy-scaler service.
# This file is a dpkg conffile — your edits survive package upgrades.

# Bind address. 0.0.0.0 accepts connections from other machines, which is
# the point of installing the server, but note the API has NO
# AUTHENTICATION: anyone who can reach this port can read and write
# projects and queue generation work on this machine's GPU.
#
# Keep it on a trusted network, or set 127.0.0.1 to make the server
# local-only.
PROXY_SCALER_SERVER_HOST=0.0.0.0

# 13207 is the same default proxy-scaler-serve uses on its own (M-T-G by
# letter position — 13th, 20th, 7th — picked to dodge the usual
# 8000/8080/8888/9000/etc collisions with other things on the network).
PROXY_SCALER_SERVER_PORT=13207

# Database, worker lock and logs.
PROXY_SCALER_DATA_DIR=/var/lib/proxy-scaler
